  "operatingHours": "Qingdao Metro runs ~6:00 AM–~10:30 PM daily (first and last trains vary by line and station; last trains from the centre leave ~10:00–10:40 PM). Trains every ~4–8 min by day, longer on outer lines and Line 8. Line 8 adds late airport express trains toward May Fourth Square until ~11:15 PM. No all-night service.",
  "fareInfo": "Distance-based single fares from ¥2 (first ~5 km) up to ~¥7–8 for the longest trips such as the airport (2026). Pay with the Alipay or WeChat transit QR code (foreign Visa/Mastercard can be linked to Alipay) or buy a cash single-journey ticket from station machines; the Qingdao Tong card gives a small discount, and 1-day/3-day passes are sold at major stations.",
